      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the coastal townland of Derreenatra, this charming three-bedroom residence enjoys a peaceful rural setting just 3.7km from the vibrant village of Schull and 6km from Ballydehob. Also, within a short stroll is Derreenatra Pier, a much-loved local swimming spot.\r\nOccupying a mature site of approximately 0.5 acres, the property is approached through a walled and gated entrance. The gardens also feature a pond, creating a wonderful outdoor space for both adults and children to enjoy.\r\nInside, the home is bright and comfortable, with a south-facing conservatory that captures the sun throughout the day and opens onto an adjoining patio area. Warmth and comfort are assured with oil-fired central heating complemented by a solid fuel stove in the living area, providing a cosy focal point during the cooler months.\r\nCombining a popular location, mature gardens and close proximity to the coast, this appealing property will suit a variety of purchasers, whether as a permanent residence or a peaceful West Cork getaway.\r\n\r\nFeatures: \r\nc. 0.5-acre plot. \r\nSouth facing Conservatory & Patio area. \r\nGarden shed.\r\nWalled and gated entrance.\r\nHeating: Oil fired central along with Solid Fuel Stove \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nSeptic Tank\r\nMains Water Supply\r\n\r\nAccommodation: \r\nEntrance Hall: (3.5m x 3m) \r\nKitchen: (3m x 3.7m) \r\nLiving Room: (4.7m x 3.1m)\r\nConservatory: (4m x 3.2m)\r\nWC: (2.7m x 1.4m)\r\nUtility Room: (3.5m x 3m)\r\n\r\n1st floor: \r\nBathroom: (2.8m x 1.3m) Electric Shower \r\nBedroom 1: (3.7m x 3.1m)\r\nBedroom 2: (4.7m x 3m)\r\nBedroom 3: (3.4m x 3m)\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
